    "row_label": "1860",
    "column_index": 3,
    "column_header": "Particulars.",
    "raw_text": "In this year the harvest was good, but the dearness of grain was caused by the Duknees, who flocked to this part of the country in consequence of the famine which ravaged the Deccan in that year. The consequence was that grain rose to from 16 to 13 seers (Suratee) per Rupee. This year of scarcity is generally known by the name of \"Satho.\"",
    "value_numeric": null,
    "unit": "Rs",
    "is_null_or_leader": false,
    "arithmetic_verified": false
  },
